  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "非營利組織與社會事業",
    "sub_ename": "SOCIAL ENTERPRISE AND NONPROFIT ORGANIZATION",
    "describe_ch": "社會事業新近被採認為最具永續經營概念的經營方式。透過社會企業家、創新社會價值、願景使命任務、服務技術創管、資源整合經管、企業社會責任和責信透明機制等事業經營管理策略、知識理論與技術經驗，本課程除希冀結合教學開導和創業模擬來建立增強社會企業創業與管理能力，並藉此與國際學府課程教材內容與教學方法等標準接軌。",
    "describe_eh": "Social enterprise has been recognized as a ventures both for profit and not-for-profit organizations for their sustainability. Such social enterprise issues as adopting a mission to create and sustain social value, pursuing and targeting new missions for opportunities to be healthy, dedicating to a incessant innovation, adaptation, and learning process, integrating various kinds of resources for social responsibility, and extending accountability and transparency for the desirable outcomes. Many facets of the social enterprise parallel the traditional corporate with the nonprofit organizations. How to apply these fundamental framework in social enterprise into nonprofit and business is thus formed as the core knowledge in this course.",
